{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerator Operator is cash chasing roguelike where you harness the power of the atom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch light speed neutron a create a chain reaction splitting materials into more neutrons. The more neutrons the more money made!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different materials have vastly different effects when hit:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fissile materials will make more neutrons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiply Neutrons and redirect them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase profits of neutrons!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain perks with powerful synergies that gives you a unique experience every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges, random starting materials, and persistent unlocks will make sure the experience always feels fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full release will include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More difficulty modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless rounds beyond round 7</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023700?t=1758076626","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023700?t=1758076626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023700/cc3f69cfadbb8718c976b91de1594e2f000eb8d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758076626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023700/cc3f69cfadbb8718c976b91de1594e